<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's National Industries H1 net up.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's National Industries H1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>			    (Million dinar unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1997			 1996</p>
<p> Net profit		  17.07			10.42</p>
<p> Net investment income   14.37			 8.64</p>
<p> Net sales income	   2.70			 1.78</p>
<p>Full name: National Industries Company (S.A.K.)</p>
<p>Note - Last week British specialist engineering and plastics group Cortworth Plc said that it had agreed a $155 million take-over offer from BI Group Plc. National Industries last year bought Britain's BI for $154 million.</p>
<p>- National Industries general assembly will hold an extraordinary meeting in September to discuss raising the capital to 60.35 million dinars from 50.30 million, the Kuwait Stock Exchange said in a statement.</p>
